  "longBusinessSummary": "Hoftex Group AG, through its subsidiaries, develops, produces, and distributes textile products for various applications in Germany, the European Union, and internationally. It engages in weaving, dyeing, and finishing of decorative fabrics; and manufactures and distributes tailor-made home textiles and sun protection solutions. The company also offers yarns and fabrics; acoustic nonwoven fabrics for the automotive industry; and nonwoven fabrics for construction, cable, medical application, and apparel sectors. The company was formerly known as Textilgruppe Hof AG and changed its name to Hoftex Group AG in January 2013. Hoftex Group AG was founded in 1853 and is headquartered in Hof, Germany.",
